purpose: Test suites for unit, integration, and e2e testing
common_tasks:
  - Writing unit tests for components
  - Creating integration tests
  - Adding e2e test scenarios
  - Mocking external dependencies
  - Testing error scenarios
  - Performance testing
watch_out_for:
  - Clean up after tests
  - Mock external services
  - Test both happy and error paths
  - Avoid flaky tests
  - Test with different storage types
  - Consider mobile viewport tests
related_files:
  - /src/**/*.test.tsx (component tests)
  - /src/**/*.test.ts (service tests)
  - /tests/mocks/* (mock implementations)
  - /tests/utils/* (test utilities)
test_command: npm run test
key_patterns:
  - Arrange-Act-Assert pattern
  - Use Testing Library best practices
  - Mock at the service boundary
  - Test user behavior not implementation
  - Comprehensive error testing